 "_comment": "The MCP artifact tool's station page (src/mcp/artifact.rs StationPage) loads <beatscript-radio> from this package on jsDelivr: the entry as a module script with this integrity and crossorigin=anonymous, and every other module it imports through an import map's integrity, so a changed file anywhere in the graph refuses to run. Pinned to an exact version, never a range, a tag or latest; a lock of its own (player-cdn.lock.json pins <beatscript-track>'s pages, the VS Code preview's and the Jupyter embed's), so the radio can move to a new version without moving them. artifact::tests hold the page to this lock (BEATSCRIPT_RADIO_PLAYER_DIR=<unpacked package> also checks the bytes). To move it: publish a new version, then run crates/beatscript-serve/deploy/player-cdn-lock.py VERSION <unpacked package> --radio --jsdelivr.",
